<h1>Cents Per Point (CPP) Calculator</h1>
<p class="sub">CPP (Cents Per Point) is the standard metric used to evaluate award flight and hotel redemptions. Enter your cash price, taxes, and points to calculate your exact return per point.</p>

<div class="direct-answer">
  <strong>What is cents per point and how do I calculate it?</strong><br>
  Cents per point (CPP) measures the net monetary value you unlock for each loyalty point or airline mile redeemed. To calculate it, subtract all mandatory award taxes and cash surcharges from the baseline cash ticket price, divide the remaining cash savings by the total points required, and multiply by 100 to convert the result into cents per point.
</div>

